.com.br/file/br-11134201-7r98o-m5kk8rjh7og5ea', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1272573624%2F22393184503', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
