icante TR6B10 Combustível FLEX GASOLINA Combustível Flex Gasolina', 94.33, 94.33, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Ignition', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbmi-llt85l98rll1de', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817551928%2F22704999564', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
