or referente ao kit EAN 7900000389101 Código do Fabricante 13913 PHI Tensão (V) 24v', 32.76, 32.76, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Lighting', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7ra1h-mbcrjmoijywm8b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817551928%2F23992930385', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
