s da transmissão (corrente, engrenagens do pé de vela, engrenagens do cassete)', 1799.0, 1137.07, NULL, 'Sports & Outdoors > Sports & Outdoor Recreation Equipments > Cycling', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-820lc-mopu53xwpq0z44', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1055795792%2F19999492205', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
